 # Changelog

+## 0.3.8 - 2026-10-07
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Fix AI zone regeneration failures caused by unsafe recursive GeoJSON
+  coordinate handling in the projection layer.
+- Validate sector and zone polygons before storing them.
+- Return a controlled error/flash message when AI zone regeneration fails.
+
+### Security
+
+- Add Flask-WTF CSRF protection to state-changing requests.
+- Change logout from GET to POST.
+- Disable Flask's development debugger in `app.py`.
+- Require a persistent `SECRET_KEY` instead of generating a new one on every restart.
+
+### Refactored
+
+- Extract pure map geometry helpers into `map-geometry.js` so they can be
+  tested independently from Leaflet UI state.
+- Add shared GeoJSON validation helpers.
+
